@title Home
@description Launch fast static pages with Blizt.

h1: Build a sharp site with Blizt

p: Blizt turns simple content and HTML pages into a static site in [code:dist].

li: Create a site with [code:npx blizt create]
li: Build HTML with [code:npx blizt build]
li: Serve locally on port [code:5000]
li: Watch changes with [code:npx blizt watch]

h2: Why it feels quick

p: Because the engine stays tiny: your pages live in [code:src/pages], your public files live in [code:src/public], and the result is plain HTML.
